  "description": {
    "text": "Players in Battle Carnival 2012 Spring's World Challenge Tournament who won three games in a row in the Challenge Stage reached the Premier Stage, where they played for the longest winning streak until about 13:00, and the top 16 of each league went on to the Climax Stage. Everyone who reached it got two mirror holo Item cards stamped with the event's logo, Max Potion and Enhanced Hammer. The Battle Carnival was held in Sendai, Yokohama, Nagoya and Osaka in May and June 2012.",
